ragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop Decoration:</strong>Buy different furniture to decorate your workshop as you like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fashion Style:</strong> Try on different clothes and accessories to create your fashion style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hero Fashion:</strong> Loving beauty is the human being's nature. Change outfits for your heroes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
